                "Fluoropl-Staithe FS-8 autoclave AC-3 holds 18.4 bar TFE, 3.6 bar under the "
                "22.0 bar rupture-disc limit, but a crown lamp flashes 24.6 bar at the shell pyrometer. "
                "Autoclave-first should keep 6.0 t/h; lamp-first would idle a legal PTFE dispersion.",